            "detailed_description": "Are you ready to go on a special mission to save the kingdom? Take command of a floating barge as you are tasked with taking a mysterious briefcase across the continent in search of the island of Amkonius.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDuring your path you will face bandits and monsters trying to destroy the barge as you are busy trying to keep your supplies and the crew’s morale from running out.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSelect crew members from among 42 different unit types to optimize the barge stats as you make your way across 25 different paths with unique stochastic events.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou have only one option, and that is to…….<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGet to Amkonius!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhat the game is:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGet to Amkonius is a bottom up scroller where you encounter stochastic events in turns.<br />\r\nYou move units on and off the barge to increase stats; different stats helping with different situations.<br />\r\nYou select from randomly generated paths with different event types.<br />\r\nAs you progress, different paths become available to you.<br />\r\nThe game was play tested at around 3 hours, depending on how fast you play.",
            "about_the_game": "Are you ready to go on a special mission to save the kingdom? Take command of a floating barge as you are tasked with taking a mysterious briefcase across the continent in search of the island of Amkonius.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDuring your path you will face bandits and monsters trying to destroy the barge as you are busy trying to keep your supplies and the crew’s morale from running out.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSelect crew members from among 42 different unit types to optimize the barge stats as you make your way across 25 different paths with unique stochastic events.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou have only one option, and that is to…….<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGet to Amkonius!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhat the game is:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGet to Amkonius is a bottom up scroller where you encounter stochastic events in turns.<br />\r\nYou move units on and off the barge to increase stats; different stats helping with different situations.<br />\r\nYou select from randomly generated paths with different event types.<br />\r\nAs you progress, different paths become available to you.<br />\r\nThe game was play tested at around 3 hours, depending on how fast you play.",
